q BT 65.20 324.65 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.382 Tw (Frank's voice came out of the speaker, low and hurried, as if he were speaking into the machine) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 304.24 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (while driving.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 274.76 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg ("If anything happens to me," Frank said, "it was Sal.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 245.28 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.459 Tw (The Don's brother-in-law. The man who had sat at his table a hundred times. The man who had) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 224.87 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (cried at Frank's empty funeral and promised to look after the boy's mother.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 195.39 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.330 Tw ("I drove him somewhere he should not have gone," Frank said on the tape. "And on the way) Tj ET Q
