q BT 65.20 771.39 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.379 Tw (The Don sat very still for a long time. Then he called his men, and he did what he had not done) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 750.98 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (in twenty years: he played the tape for them, all of it, from the beginning.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 721.50 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.015 Tw (Sal was taken before the sun went down. He did not deny it. Men like Sal never deny it; they) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 701.09 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (only ask what the price will be. The Don gave him no price. He gave him the door.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 671.61 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.680 Tw (That night, the Don stood at the gate with Mikey, and the boy looked up at the big house -- no) Tj ET Q
