q BT 65.20 601.31 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.757 Tw (because he would not lie for a thief. You will never walk here alone at midnight again. This is) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 580.90 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (your home now.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 551.42 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Mikey nodded, and for the first time since the rain, he let go of the rusted key.) Tj ET Q
